{title: Mahiye Jinna Sohna}
{artist: Darshan Raval}
{key: C#}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#] Kya Bataun Main Tujhey,        [A#m] Tu Hai Jo Mila Mujhey
[F#] Ho Gayi Hai Rabb Di [G#] Aamadaan,        [C#] Itne Naseeb Se
[A#m] Dekha Hai Kareeb Se,        [F#] Noor Diyaan Hoyiaan [G#] Baarishaan
[C#] Ho Sajke Jo Aaye Tu,        [A#m] Akhiyon Ke Saamne
[F#] Nazraan Lagein Na [G#] Meriaan,        Mere [C#] Mahiye Jinna Sohna
Na Koi [A#m] Hoya Na Koi Hona,        Je Mai [F#] Pittal Te Tu Sona [G#] Bakhudaa
Mere [C#] Mahiye Jinna Sohna,        Na Koi [A#m] Hoya Na Koi Hona
Je Mai [F#] Pittal Te Tu Sona [G#] Bakhudaa,        [C#] Tera Milna Hi Meri
[A#m] Chaand Raat Hogi,        [F#] Ishq Wale Raaston Mein
[G#] Apni Baat Hogi,        [C#] Ambar Mein Taaro Ki
[A#m] Baarat Hogi,        [F#] Dhoondegi Yeh Duniya Par Tu
[G#] Mere Saath Hogi,        [C#] Baaki Saare Saal Ve
[A#m] Rehna Tere Naal Ve,        [F#] Khwahishaan Ve Channa [G#] Meriaan
Mere [C#] Mahiye Jinna Sohna,        Na Koi [A#m] Hoya Na Koi Hona
Je Mai [F#] Pittal Te Tu Sona [G#] Bakhudaa
